My attention goes to the nearby counter.
There is a large glass jar there.
There are nice bakery items in it.
I want something sweet now.
I look around.
The waiter is standing nearby.
I call him over.
He comes near my table.
"Bhaiya, will I get a fresh mawa cake?" I ask politely.
He smiles and nods.
"Yes Madam, it is completely fresh," he says.
"Then will you give me one slice?" I ask.
"Yes Madam, I will bring it right away," he says.
He goes towards the counter again.
He takes out a slice of cake from the jar.
I happily wait for my sweet treat.
